{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_76","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/sh -lc \"cat /opt/alva/AEP_TOOLS.md; echo '---'; cat /opt/alva/agent_entrypoint.sh; echo '---'; cat /opt/alva/isolation_self_test.sh\"","aggregated_output":"# AEP 工具参考（mode C，Log task）\n\n模式 C 只能通过 AEP 工具修改程序（AIR 为权威表示），禁止创建/修改 `.alva`\n文件。所有工具通过 gateway 调用：\n\n```text\npython3 /opt/alva/aep.py --port <port> <tool> key=value ...\n```\n\n端口写在 `/workspace/port.txt`。\n\n## 常用流程\n\n1. `begin_transaction project=/workspace/alva.toml`（必须先调用）；\n2. 用 `inspect_*` 了解现状；\n3. 用 `create_*` / `add_*` 构造节点，用 `append_step` / `replace_expression` 修改；\n4. `check_transaction`（commit 前必须调用；`ok:false` 时修复后重试）；\n5. `commit_transaction`（写入权威 AIR store）；\n6. `abort_transaction`（放弃当前事务）。\n\n## 只读\n\n- `inspect_project` —— 项目 revision 与模块列表；\n- `inspect_module name=<模块名>` —— 模块视图；\n- `inspect_function name=<模块名> <函数名>` —— 函数视图 + body 树；\n- `inspect_entity name=<entity id>` —— 实体视图；\n- `inspect_body function=<模块名> <函数名>` —— body 递归结构树（每个节点含\n  kind/name/value/revision）；\n- `inspect_test module=<模块名> name=<测试名>` —— 测试节点与 body 树；\n- `list_candidates ...` —— typed hole 候选。\n\n## 写入\n\n- `create_literal type=<string|i64|...> value=<值>` —— 字面量；\n- `create_reference name=<符号名>` —— 引用已有符号（如函数参数）；\n- `create_call name=<被调函数名> args=<rev> [args=<rev> ...]` —— 调用节点；\n- `create_binding name=<名字> type_name=<类型> value=<rev>` —— 绑定；\n- `create_block steps=<rev> [steps=<rev> ...]` —— block；\n- `create_if cond=<rev> then=<rev> else=<rev>` —— if 节点；\n- `create_binary op=<==|+|-|...> left=<rev> right=<rev>` —— 二元运算；\n- `create_query kind=<contains|any|all|find> collection=<rev> [target=<rev>]\n  [elem_var=<名字>] [predicate=<rev>]` —— 查询表达式；\n- `append_step function=<模块名> <函数名> step=<rev>` —— 追加到函数 body block 末尾；\n- `replace_expression parent=<rev> child=<rev> position=<...>` —— 替换子表达式；\n- `add_function module=<模块名> name=<名字> returns=<类型> [params=...]` —— 新函数；\n- `add_field type=<类型名> name=<字段名> type_name=<类型>` —— record 类型加字段；\n- `add_record_field record=<record 节点 rev> name=<字段名> value=<值 rev>` —— 构造点加字段；\n- `update_record_fields type=<record 类型名> base=<表达式 rev> updates={字段: 值 rev}`\n  —— 部分 record 更新（未指定字段保留）；\n- `add_param function=<模块名> <函数名> name=<名字> type=<类型>` —— 加参数；\n- `add_call_arg call=<call 节点 rev> arg=<rev>` —— 调用点加实参；\n- `set_effect function=<模块名> <函数名> effect=<pure|io>` —— 函数 effect；\n- `add_cap module=<模块名> cap=<cap>` —— 模块 capability；\n- `change_field entity=<entity id> field=<字段> value=<值>` —— 修改字段；\n- `rename_entity name=<entity id> new_name=<名字>` —— 重命名实体。\n\n## 事务\n\n- `begin_transaction project=<alva.toml 绝对路径>`；\n- `check_transaction` —— 结构 + 全量语义校验（类型/effect/契约，含跨模块）；\n- `commit_transaction` —— 写入权威 AIR store；\n- `abort_transaction` —— 放弃。\n\n## 重要语义\n\n1. block 的最后一个表达式就是函数返回值：`append_step` 总是追加到 block 末尾，\n   会挤掉原返回值——追加新步骤后必须再追加恢复返回表达式；\n2. `check_transaction` 做结构 + 全量语义校验；类型/effect 错误会在 commit 前拒绝；\n3. 每次写操作返回的 `revision` 是后续操作的参数；不要猜测 revision；\n4. 引用函数参数用 `create_reference name=<参数名>` 拿到引用节点 revision；\n5. `inspect_body` 返回的 revision 可直接作为后续工具参数；\n6. 短前缀（如 `e8419ffaabcc`）可代完整 revision；前缀不唯一返回\n   `E_AEP_ENTITY_NOT_FOUND`（带 candidates）。\n---\n#!/usr/bin/env bash\nset -euo pipefail\n# Container entrypoint: run the isolation self-test, then the agent.\n/opt/alva/isolation_self_test.sh\nARGS=(-C /workspace -s workspace-write --skip-git-repo-check\n  --ephemeral --json\n  -c \"model_provider=${ALVA_PROVIDER:-deepseek}\"\n  -c preferred_auth_method=apikey\n  -c forced_login_method=api\n  -m \"${CODEX_MODEL:-deepseek-v4-flash}\")\n# The container itself is the isolation boundary (no repo mount, relay-only\n# network), so codex's internal bwrap sandbox is redundant and unavailable\n# here; bypass it inside the container only.\nARGS+=(--dangerously-bypass-approvals-and-sandbox)\n\nif [ \"${MODE:-A}\" = \"C\" ]; then\n  # Start the AEP gateway inside the container (localhost only), then let the\n  # agent reach it at 127.0.0.1:<port from /workspace/port.txt>.\n  /opt/alva/ac_client.py serve \\\n    --alva /usr/local/bin/alva \\\n    --project /workspace/alva.toml \\\n    --port 0 --state /workspace &\n  for _ in $(seq 1 100); do\n    [ -f /workspace/port.txt ] && break\n    sleep 0.1\n  done\n  if [ ! -f /workspace/port.txt ]; then\n    echo \"FATAL: AEP gateway failed to start (no /workspace/port.txt)\" >&2\n    exit 1\n  fi\nfi\n\nif [ -f /workspace/prompt.txt ]; then\n  # Robust path: read the prompt from a file via stdin (avoids any\n  # multi-layer shell quoting of multi-word prompts).\n  cat /workspace/prompt.txt | exec codex exec \"${ARGS[@]}\" -\nelse\n  exec codex exec \"${ARGS[@]}\" \"$@\"\nfi\n---\n#!/usr/bin/env bash\nset -euo pipefail\nFAIL=0\n\ncheck_fail_read() {\n  if [ -r \"$1\" ]; then\n    echo \"FAIL: $1 is readable (must NOT be mounted)\"\n    FAIL=1\n  else\n    echo \"PASS: $1 not readable\"\n  fi\n}\n\ncheck_fail_write() {\n  if touch \"$1\" 2>/dev/null; then\n    echo \"FAIL: $1 is writable (must be read-only outside /workspace)\"\n    FAIL=1\n  else\n    echo \"PASS: $1 not writable\"\n  fi\n}\n\n# 1. held-out verifier / host secrets must not be mounted\ncheck_fail_read /host-secrets/marker\ncheck_fail_read /repo\n# 2. no repository mount\nif [ -d /repo ]; then\n  echo \"FAIL: /repo is present\"\n  FAIL=1\nelse\n  echo \"PASS: no /repo mount\"\nfi\n# 3. network: relay reachable, non-relay blocked (relay-only policy)\nRELAY=\"${MODEL_RELAY:-https://api.deepseek.com}\"\nRELAY_CODE=\"$(curl -s -m 8 -o /dev/null -w '%{http_code}' \"$RELAY\" 2>/dev/null || true)\"\nif [ -n \"$RELAY_CODE\" ] && [ \"$RELAY_CODE\" != \"000\" ]; then\n  echo \"PASS: relay reachable\"\nelse\n  echo \"FAIL: relay unreachable (http_code=$RELAY_CODE)\"\n  FAIL=1\nfi\nif curl -fsS -m 8 -o /dev/null https://example.com 2>/dev/null; then\n  echo \"FAIL: non-relay host reachable (network not relay-only)\"\n  FAIL=1\nelse\n  echo \"PASS: non-relay host blocked\"\nfi\n# 4. workspace writable, root read-only\nif touch /workspace/.probe 2>/dev/null && rm /workspace/.probe; then\n  echo \"PASS: /workspace writable\"\nelse\n  echo \"FAIL: /workspace not writable\"\n  FAIL=1\nfi\ncheck_fail_write /root/.probe\ncheck_fail_write /opt/alva/.probe\n\nexit $FAIL\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
