{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_548","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/sh -lc \"python3 /opt/alva/aep.py --port 33917 abort_transaction; sed -n '1,40p' /workspace/TASK.md\"","aggregated_output":"{\"protocol_version\":\"0.7-replication\",\"request_id\":\"\",\"op_index\":510,\"ok\":true,\"error_code\":\"ok\",\"result\":{\"aborted\":true},\"diagnostics\":[],\"message\":\"aborted\"}\n# Task: H06 — Approval workflow: transition + associated-data invariant\n\n> Held-out RFC-0005 suite · Shape: State-machine invariant (2/2).\n> You are maintaining an **existing correct system**; do not rewrite it from\n> scratch. Change only what the task requires.\n\n## Base (workspace)\n\nThe workspace contains a correct, deterministic approval-workflow program\n(single module). A case has a status from `Draft / UnderReview / Approved /\nRejected` and already carries a `decision_reason` string field (no schema\nevolution needed). Operations: `submit`, `approve`, `reject(reason)`,\n`reopen`. The current rules are **looser** than the required contract (e.g.,\na draft can be approved directly, an empty reject reason is accepted, and a\nstale decision reason survives approve/reopen). There is no persistence, no\nwall-clock dependency, and no restart logic.\n\nThe program is driven by the environment variable `H06_SCENARIO` and prints\ndeterministic lines.\n\n## Required change\n\nTighten the workflow to exactly:\n\n```text\nsubmit:        Draft       -> UnderReview\napprove:       UnderReview -> Approved      (decision_reason MUST be cleared)\nreject(reason): UnderReview -> Rejected     (reason MUST be non-empty and saved)\nreopen:        Rejected    -> UnderReview   (decision_reason MUST be cleared)\n```\n\nwith the invariants:\n\n- `Approved` may not be reopened or rejected;\n- `Draft` may not be approved or rejected;\n- a `Rejected` case may not be rejected again;\n- any illegal transition must fail with an explicit error whose text starts\n  with `E_H06_STATE:` and names the operation and the source state;\n- rejecting with an empty reason must fail with an explicit error whose text\n  starts with `E_H06_REASON:`;\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
